))\\n/Users/sto/workspace/datomworld/.claude/worktrees/jolt-j0c/src/jolt/yang/antlr/cst.jolt-41-\\n/Users/sto/workspace/datomworld/.claude/worktrees/jolt-j0c/src/jolt/yang/antlr/cst.jolt-42-\\n/Users/sto/workspace/datomworld/.claude/worktrees/jolt-j0c/src/jolt/yang/antlr/cst.jolt-43-(def library\\n.claude/worktrees/jolt-j0c/src/jolt/yang/antlr/cst.jolt-44-  \\\"The wrapper `bb build:jolt-native` builds, under the working directory.\\\"\\n.claude/worktrees/jolt-j0c/src/jolt/yang/antlr/cst.jolt:45:  (str (System/getProperty \\\"user.dir\\\") \\\"/build/native/\\\" platform\\n/Users/sto/workspace/datomworld/.claude/worktrees/jolt-j0c/src/jolt/yang/antlr/cst.jolt-46-       \\\"/jolt-parser/lib/libjolt_parser\\\"\\n.claude/worktrees/jolt-j0c/src/jolt/yang/antlr/cst.jolt:47:       (if (str/starts-with? platform \\\"darwin\\\") \\\".dylib\\\" \\\".so\\\")))\\n/Users/sto/workspace/datomworld/.claude/worktrees/jolt-j0c/src/jolt/yang/antlr/cst.jolt-48-\\n/Users/sto/workspace/datomworld/.claude/worktrees/jolt-j0c/src/jolt/yang/antlr/cst.jolt-49-\\n/Users/sto/workspace/datomworld/.claude/worktrees/jolt-j0c/src/jolt/yang/antlr/cst.jolt-50-(ffi/load-library library)\\n--\\n/Users/sto/workspace/datomworld/.claude/worktrees/jolt-j0c/src/jolt/yang/antlr/cst.jolt-74-\\n/Users/sto/workspace/datomworld/.claude/worktrees/jolt-j0c/src/jolt/yang/antlr/cst.jolt-75-\\n/Users/sto/workspace/datomworld/.claude/worktrees/jolt-j0c/src/jolt/yang/antlr/cst.jolt-76-;; =============================================================================\\n.claude/worktrees/jolt-j0c/src/jolt/yang/antlr/cst.jolt:77:;; Decoding the private layout, checked\\n/Users/sto/workspace/datomworld/.claude/worktrees/jolt-j0c/src/jolt/yang/antlr/cst.jolt-78-;; =============================================================================\\n/Users/sto/workspace/datomworld/.claude/worktrees/jolt-j0c/src/jolt/yang/antlr/cst.jolt-79-\\n/Users/sto/workspace/datomworld/.claude/worktrees/jolt-j0c/src/jolt/yang/antlr/cst.jolt-80-