nt\n- 1e017ca8 chore(collab): file the old archive/collab topic into its subsystems\n- 4c8d87eb chore(collab): the archive becomes collab/ — one version-controlled collaboration root\n- c02c7c5f docs(agents): restore the dao.stream merge precondition dropped by the dedup pass\n- 9e78c042 docs(archive): the 8.10 common-call artifacts under archive/yang-python/810-common-call; the retake session's final handoff entry\n- ad8e3a9c fix(jolt-parser): free the full-context reach set on the exception path (J5c, the P3 leak)\n- f1b33c0f docs(agents): drop the stale pre-ruling copy of the nightly/branch-testing section (the owner ruling's final text stands alone)\n\n## Automated Scan Findings\n✅ No critical security or code quality smells detected by automated scan.\n\n## File Churn & Risk Breakdown\n| File Path | Category | +Add | -Del | Risk |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| `src/dev/cljd_agg.clj` | Source Code | +37 | -22 | `Medium` |\n| `orchestrator-logs/1793292851-yang-python-retake.md` | Documentation | +55 | -0 | `Low` |\n\n## Reviewer Focus & Recommendations\n- 🧪 **Testing:** Test coverage appears low relative to source code additions. Request unit/integration test additions.\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
